[[10753,4121,"During the inquest staff confirmed that they record information about patients in two ways. On the electronic records and on handwritten handover sheets.","inconsistent record keeping",""],[10754,4121,"There were numerous inaccuracies in Matthew's medical records, eg his status was written as informal when he was formal, he was described as violent when he was not and was described as","inaccurate clinical records",""],[10755,4121,"Despite this, and with clear evidence that Matthew was at risk of absconsion, his risk assessment was not updated over the weekend when the risk materialised","inadequate risk assessment updates",""],[10756,4121,"A patient absconded over the courtyard fence during the inquest which indicates the courtyard area is not safe","unsafe courtyard environment",""],[10757,4121,"National guidelines for perimeter fences and security in acute mental health unit outside areas","lack of standard perimeter fence guidelines",""]]